      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْزِلٌ شَاحِطٌ</span></b>  <i>A distant,</i> or <i>remote, place of
abode;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحَّاطٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
